Migration setup
===============

The initial revision creates the SQLAlchemy metadata for a fresh database. For production deployments, run migrations with the same DATABASE_URL used by the application:

  alembic upgrade head

When changing model definitions, generate and review a new migration before applying it:

  alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"

The application startup still creates missing tables as a convenience for development and new installations. It does not alter existing tables; use Alembic for schema changes.
